msgid "Freedom! I'll find a good book and tuck in."
msgstr "Liberdade! Encontrarei um bom livro e vou me recolher."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_GHOSTDRAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_GHOSTDRAIN"
msgid "My humanity... it's slipping."
msgstr "Minha humanidade... Está se esvaindo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HIGHRESEARCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HIGHRESEARCH"
msgid "My my, that was extremely interesting!"
msgstr "Nossa, isso foi extremamente interessante!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HOT"
msgid "The ambient temperature is high."
msgstr "A temperatura ambiente está alta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HOUNDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HOUNDS"
msgid "Something is approaching."
msgstr "Algo está se aproximando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HUNGRY"
msgid "Librarian needs food."
msgstr "Bibliotecária precisa de comida."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_BEAST_NEARBY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_BEAST_NEARBY"
msgid "The appearance of this track indicates recent activity."
msgstr "A aparência desse rastro indica atividade recente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL"
msgid "The trail is no longer distinguishable."
msgstr "O rastro não é mais distinguível."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL_SPRING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL_SPRING"
msgid "The trail's been washed away by the precipitation."
msgstr "O rastro foi apagado pela precipitação."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_INSUFFICIENTFERTILIZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_INSUFFICIENTFERTILIZER"
msgid "It needs just a touch more fecal assistance, I'd say."
msgstr "Só precisa de um pouquinho mais de auxílio fecal, eu diria."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_INV_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_INV_FULL"
msgid "I can't carry anything more."
msgstr "Não posso carregar mais nada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_CALLFORHELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_CALLFORHELP"
msgid "Careful! It has summoned lesser Krampii."
msgstr "Cuidado! Invocou Krampii inferiores."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_ENRAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_ENRAGE"
msgid "No sense throwing one's life away. Fall back!"
msgstr "Não há sentindo desperdiçar a vida. Recue!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_UNCHAINED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_UNCHAINED"
msgid "Whatever enchantment restrained it has been undone."
msgstr "Seja lá o encantamento que o prendeu, foi desfeito."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KNOCKEDOUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KNOCKEDOUT"
msgid "Oof, that's one way to get some rest, I suppose."
msgstr "Ufa, essa é uma maneira de descansar um pouco, acho eu."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_LIGHTNING_DAMAGE_AVOIDED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_LIGHTNING_DAMAGE_AVOIDED"
msgid "Thank goodness for this non-conductive clothing!"
msgstr "Ainda bem que existe essa roupa isolante!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_LOWRESEARCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_LOWRESEARCH"
msgid "Not a great resource, but there were useful bits."
msgstr "Não é um ótimo recurso, mas havia partes úteis."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MOSQUITOS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MOSQUITOS"
msgid "Cursed bloodsuckers!"
msgstr "Sugadores de sangue desgraçados!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MOUNT_LOWHEALTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MOUNT_LOWHEALTH"
msgid "My mount requires attention of the medical variety."
msgstr "Minha montaria exige atenção de uma variedade médica."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERAFK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERAFK"
msgid "Were I to lose focus now I'd be sure to sustain bodily injury."
msgstr "Se eu perdesse a concentração agora certamente sofreria lesões corporais."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERGIFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERGIFT"
msgid "Presents are not a top survival priority at this moment."
msgstr "Presentes não são uma prioridade de sobrevivência no momento."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSIESTA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSIESTA"
msgid "I can't lie down when I'm in danger!"
msgstr "Não posso deitar quando estou em perigo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSLEEP"
msgid "I can barely sleep even when I'm not in danger!"
msgstr "Mal posso dormir, mesmo quando não estou em perigo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP"
msgid "I can hardly get to sleep at night, nevermind during the day."
msgstr "Mal posso dormir à noite, quanto mais de dia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP_CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP_CAVE"
msgid "These caves don't make it any easier to sleep."
msgstr "Essas cavernas não facilitam o sono."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSIESTA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSIESTA"
msgid "My hunger won't make relaxing any easier!"
msgstr "Minha fome não vai facilitar o relaxamento!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSLEEP"
msgid "I can barely sleep even when I'm not starving!"
msgstr "Mal posso dormir, mesmo quando não estou passando fome."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NOMOUNTEDGIFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NOMOUNTEDGIFT"
msgid "I do believe I should dismount first."
msgstr "Realmente acredito que devo desmontar primeiro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA"
msgid "I can't sleep, no matter where I lie down."
msgstr "Não consigo dormir, não importa onde eu deite."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA_CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA_CAVE"
msgid "I couldn't possibly relax in these caves."
msgstr "Eu não conseguiria relaxar nessas cavernas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NOSLEEPONFIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NOSLEEPONFIRE"
msgid "Even if I could sleep, these temperatures are highly unsafe."
msgstr "Mesmo que eu pudesse dormir, essas temperaturas são altamente inseguras."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NOWARDROBEONFIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NOWARDROBEONFIRE"
msgid "As you can plainly see, it is ablaze."
msgstr "Como você pode ver claramente, está em chamas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NO_TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NO_TRAP"
msgid "A cinch!"
msgstr "Barbada!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_PECKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_PECKED"
msgid "Settle down, this instant!"
msgstr "Acalme-se, agora mesmo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_PETRIFED_TREES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_PETRIFED_TREES"
msgid "The chemical reaction has been catalyzed..."
msgstr "A reação química foi catalisada..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_PICK_DISEASE_WARNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_PICK_DISEASE_WARNING"
msgid "This plant is exhibiting concerning signs."
msgstr "Esta planta está exibindo sinais de preocupação."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_QUAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_QUAKE"
msgid "A tremor! At least magnitude seven on the Richter scale."
msgstr "Um tremor! Magnitude de pelo menos 7 na escala Richter."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_REPELLED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_REPELLED"
msgid "There's magic at work here."
msgstr "Há uma magia em ação aqui."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_RESEARCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_RESEARCH"
msgid "No information should go to waste, no matter how trivial."
msgstr "Nenhuma informação deve ser desperdiçada, independente de sua trivialidade."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_FROM_CORPSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_FROM_CORPSE"
msgid "Oof! Back on my feet!"
msgstr "Ufa! De pé novamente!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_OTHER_CORPSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_OTHER_CORPSE"
msgid "Off you go now."
msgstr "Pode ir, meu bem."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_REVIVING_CORPSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_REVIVING_CORPSE"
msgid "Hold on a moment, dear."
msgstr "Espere um pouco, meu bem."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_RUINS_RESET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_RUINS_RESET"
msgid "Careful, the monsters are back."
msgstr "Cuidado, os monstros voltaram."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_NO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_NO"
msgid "Shoot. I thought I had it."
msgstr "Droga. Achei que tinha conseguido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_YES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_YES"
msgid "That did the trick."
msgstr "Assim deu certo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SHELTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SHELTER"
msgid "Ah, a welcome respite."
msgstr "Ah, um descanso bem-vindo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SNARED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SNARED"
msgid "You can't hold me for long, dear."
msgstr "Você não pode me deter por muito tempo, benzinho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SOAKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SOAKED"
msgid "Positively soaked."
msgstr "Totalmente ensopada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_THORNS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_THORNS"
msgid "Dang spinose structure!"
msgstr "Droga de estrutura espinhosa!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_THURIBLE_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_THURIBLE_OUT"
msgid "That's that."
msgstr "É isso, então."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPED"
msgid "It has burrowed away."
msgstr "Se enterrou."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPING"
msgid "It will need to burrow soon to rehydrate its skin."
msgstr "Logo vai precisar se enterrar para reidratar sua pele."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_SLIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_SLIP"
msgid "My grip!"
msgstr "Segura firme!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TOOMANYBIRDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TOOMANYBIRDS"
msgid "It doesn't work as well with this many birds around."
msgstr "Não funciona tão bem com tantos pássaros por perto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TORCH_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TORCH_OUT"
msgid "I need another light."
msgstr "Preciso de outra luz."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TOWNPORTALTELEPORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TOWNPORTALTELEPORT"
msgid "Goodness! That's one way to travel."
msgstr "Céus! Uma opção para viajar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TRAP_WENT_OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TRAP_WENT_OFF"
msgid "Eek!"
msgstr "Ugh!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_UNIMPLEMENTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_UNIMPLEMENTED"
msgid "Tut tut, I don't think it's quite ready."
msgstr "Acho que ainda não está pronto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WAYTOOMANYBIRDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WAYTOOMANYBIRDS"
msgid "The sky is out of birds for now."
msgstr "O céu não tem mais pássaros por enquanto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WET"
msgid "I wonder what my body's saturation point is..."
msgstr "Qual será o ponto de saturação do meu corpo..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WETTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WETTER"
msgid "Wet, wet, wet!"
msgstr "Molhada, molhada, molhada!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WORMHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WORMHOLE"
msgid "A detailed lesson in biology!"
msgstr "Uma lição detalhada de biologia!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WORMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WORMS"
msgid "Something nasty intends to rear its head."
msgstr "Algo horrível pretende erguer sua cabeça."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.BATTLECRY.DEER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.BATTLECRY.DEER"
msgid "This will be easy."
msgstr "Isso vai ser fácil."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.BATTLECRY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.BATTLECRY.GENERIC"
msgid "Combat!"
msgstr "Combate!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.BATTLECRY.PIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.BATTLECRY.PIG"
msgid "Foul cad!"
msgstr "Biltre inútil!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.BATTLECRY.PREY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.BATTLECRY.PREY"
msgid "Just give up."
msgstr "Desista."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.BATTLECRY.SPIDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.BATTLECRY.SPIDER"
msgid "Behave!"
msgstr "Comporte-se!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.BATTLECRY.SPIDER_WARRIOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.BATTLECRY.SPIDER_WARRIOR"
msgid "Respect your elders!"
msgstr "Respeite os mais velhos!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.COMBAT_QUIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.COMBAT_QUIT.GENERIC"
msgid "Well, that's over."
msgstr "Bem, essa já era."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.COMBAT_QUIT.PIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.COMBAT_QUIT.PIG"
msgid "Oh dear."
msgstr "Oh, meu santo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.COMBAT_QUIT.PREY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.COMBAT_QUIT.PREY"
msgid "I must reassess the situation."
msgstr "Preciso reavaliar a situação."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER"
msgid "I must read up on this!"
msgstr "Preciso ler isso!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER_WARRIOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER_WARRIOR"
msgid "Back to the drawing board!"
msgstr "De volta à mesa de projetos!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL"
msgid "Fascinating. Can you speak, specter?"
msgstr "Fascinante. Você fala, espectro?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.GENERIC"
msgid "Ah... I'm not familiar with this strain of flower."
msgstr "Ah... Desconheço essa variedade de flor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_GROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_GROUND"
msgid "Does it expect something of me?"
msgstr "Será que está esperando alguma coisa de mim?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_POCKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_POCKET"
msgid "I feel I should set it down now."
msgstr "Acho que devo largá-la agora."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LONG"
msgid "Odd..."
msgstr "Estranho..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.MEDIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.MEDIUM"
msgid "It's emitting a strange energy."
msgstr "Está emitindo uma energia estranha."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.SOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.SOON"
msgid "The flower's energy is growing powerful."
msgstr "A energia da flor está ficando mais poderosa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ACCOMPLISHMENT_SHRINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ACCOMPLISHMENT_SHRINE"
msgid "I feel a compulsive urge to activate it, again and again."
msgstr "Sinto uma vontade compulsiva de ativá-lo, muitas vezes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ACORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ACORN"
msgid "Deciduous seeds encased in a Pericarp."
msgstr "Sementes de decídua encapsuladas em um pericarpo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ACORN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ACORN_COOKED"
msgid "The poison has been successfully cooked out of them."
msgstr "O veneno foi retirado com o cozimento."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ACORN_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ACORN_SAPLING"
msgid "Deciduous seeds approaching maturity."
msgstr "As sementes de decídua se aproximam da maturidade."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ADVENTURE_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ADVENTURE_PORTAL"
msgid "That violates some pretty fundamental physical laws."
msgstr "Isso viola algumas leis físicas bem fundamentais."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.AMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.AMULET"
msgid "A relic from another time."
msgstr "Uma relíquia de outros tempos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR"
msgid "A monument to some long dead god."
msgstr "Um monumento em homenagem a algum deus morto há muito tempo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR_BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR_BROKEN"
msgid "Parts of this are missing."
msgstr "Algumas partes disso estão faltando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_STATUE"
msgid "This seems mystically aligned to the world."
msgstr "Isso parece misticamente alinhado com o mundo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ANIMAL_TRACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ANIMAL_TRACK"
msgid "A sign of animal activity. Leads away."
msgstr "Um sinal de atividade animal. Leva para longe."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.GENERIC"
msgid "Ah. You must be behind all the seismic activity."
msgstr "Ah. É você que deve estar por trás de toda a atividade sísmica."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.UNHAPPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.UNHAPPY"
msgid "Panthera auropunctata is looking irritable."
msgstr "A Panthera auropunctata parece irritada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.VERYHAPPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.VERYHAPPY"
msgid "It has been mollified with tributes."
msgstr "Foi acalmada com homenagens."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONTRINKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONTRINKET"
msgid "It appears to be a child's plaything."
msgstr "Parece ser um brinquedo de criança."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARMORDRAGONFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARMORDRAGONFLY"
msgid "Pyrotechnic armor!"
msgstr "Proteção pirotécnica!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARMORGRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARMORGRASS"
msgid "Surprisingly effective with enough layers."
msgstr "Surpreendentemente eficaz com camadas suficientes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARMORMARBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARMORMARBLE"
msgid "An interesting choice of materials."
msgstr "Uma seleção interessante de materiais."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARMORRUINS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARMORRUINS"
msgid "A hardy Thulecite armor."
msgstr "Um colete de tulecita resistente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARMORSKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARMORSKELETON"
msgid "Now it's an exoskeleton. Ho ho!"
msgstr "Agora é um exoesqueleto. Ho, ho!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARMORSLURPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARMORSLURPER"
msgid "A disgusting and magical garment."
msgstr "Um traje nojento e mágico."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARMORSNURTLESHELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARMORSNURTLESHELL"
msgid "It is quite capacious."
msgstr "É bem espaçoso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARMORWOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARMORWOOD"
msgid "Crude plate mail cobbled together from log sections."
msgstr "Cota de placa rude unida com partes de tronco."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_SANITY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_SANITY"
msgid "A protective shroud that transfers attacks to another dimension."
msgstr "Uma capa protetora que transfere os ataques para outra dimensão."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.BURNT"
msgid "Not much of an aid now."
msgstr "Não vai auxiliar muito agora."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.GENERIC"
msgid "A navigational aid. \"Thataway\"."
msgstr "Um auxílio navegacional. \"Pra lá\"."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.UNWRITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.UNWRITTEN"
msgid "A chance to give direction."
msgstr "Uma chance de indicar a direção."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.BURNT"
msgid "Not much of an aid now."
msgstr "Não vai auxiliar muito agora."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.GENERIC"
msgid "A navigational aid. \"Thataway\"."
msgstr "Um auxílio navegacional. \"Pra lá\"."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.UNWRITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.UNWRITTEN"
msgid "A chance to give direction."
msgstr "Uma chance de indicar a direção."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ASH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ASH.GENERIC"
msgid "Some non-aqueous residue remains after the fire."
msgstr "Um pouco de resíduo não aquoso ficou depois do fogo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_EYE_BONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_EYE_BONE"
msgid "The eyebone seems to have been burned entirely."
msgstr "O osso ocular parecer ter sido completamente carbonizado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_GLOMMERFLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_GLOMMERFLOWER"
msgid "The flower appears to have been completely burned up."
msgstr "A flor parece ter sido completamente carbonizada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_THINGIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_THINGIE"
msgid "This used to be something, but now it's just a pile of ash."
msgstr "Isso costumava ser algo, agora é só um monte de cinzas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.CHARGING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.CHARGING"
msgid "It is storing power."
msgstr "Está concentrando força."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.COOLDOWN"
msgid "We must be patient."
msgstr "Precisamos ser pacientes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.DESTABILIZING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.DESTABILIZING"
msgid "We'd best not be around when it goes off."
msgstr "É melhor não estarmos por perto quando ativar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.OFF"
msgid "Now where might that lead?"
msgstr "Para onde será que vai?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.ON"
msgid "That's taken care of."
msgstr "Já cuidamos disso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_KEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_KEY"
msgid "The key to that old gateway."
msgstr "A chave para o velho portal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.OFF"
msgid "I suspect it is powered by that horrible fuel."
msgstr "Suspeito que seja movido por aquele combustível horrível."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.ON"
msgid "Indeed. It gained power from the key."
msgstr "É claro. Obteve energia da chave."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_OVERGROWTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_OVERGROWTH"
msgid "It would take much too long to decipher."
msgstr "Demoraria muito tempo para decifrar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_1"
msgid "An ancient mural of a non-mammalian civilization."
msgstr "Um mural ancestral de uma civilização não mamífera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_2"
msgid "This mural panel is too eroded to decipher."
msgstr "Esse painel está muito desgastado para se decifrar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_3"
msgid "A dark shadow, or perhaps a substance, overtakes the civilization."
msgstr "Uma sombra escura, ou talvez uma substância, domina a civilização."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_4"
msgid "The citizens molt from their exoskeletons in this panel."
msgstr "Os cidadãos deixam seus exoesqueletos neste painel."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_5"
msgid "The city appears exponentially more prosperous."
msgstr "A cidade parece potencialmente mais próspera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_STATUE"
msgid "It refuses to comply with this world's laws."
msgstr "Se recusa a seguir as leis do mundo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.AXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.AXE"
msgid "A dual inclined plane attached to a lever."
msgstr "Um plano inclinado duplo anexado a uma alavanca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.GENERIC"
msgid "Look at his widdle face! (Ahem!)"
msgstr "Olha essa carinha fofa! (Ahem!)"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.SLEEPING"
msgid "He's even more darling in sleep."
msgstr "Ele é ainda mais querido dormindo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BACKPACK"
msgid "That could carry so many books."
msgstr "Isso poderia carregar muitos livros."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BACONEGGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BACONEGGS"
msgid "Blue eggs and bacon!"
msgstr "Ovos azuis e bacon!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BALLOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BALLOON"
msgid "Could serve as a suitable diversion."
msgstr "Poderia servir como uma dissuasão útil."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BALLOONS_EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BALLOONS_EMPTY"
msgid "These seem frivolous."
msgstr "Esses parecem ser levianos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE"
msgid "Medicinal dressings."
msgstr "Curativos medicinais."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BASALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BASALT"
msgid "Material of great density!"
msgstr "Material de grande densidade!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BAT"
msgid "A flying mammal."
msgstr "Um mamífero voador."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BATBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BATBAT"
msgid "Interesting. This weapon appears to be alive."
msgstr "Interessante. Essa arma parece estar viva."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BATCAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BATCAVE"
msgid "This nook is actually a dwelling."
msgstr "Esse nicho é na verdade uma habitação."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BATWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BATWING"
msgid "Technically edible."
msgstr "Tecnicamente comestível."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BATWING_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BATWING_COOKED"
msgid "Technically edible."
msgstr "Tecnicamente comestível."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEARDHAIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEARDHAIR"
msgid "This is human facial hair."
msgstr "Isso é pelo facial humano."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEARGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEARGER"
msgid "It's the Caniformia suborder... Beyond that, I cannot say."
msgstr "É a subordem Caniformia... Além disso, nada posso dizer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEARGERVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEARGERVEST"
msgid "Whatever it was, its pelt makes for a fine garment."
msgstr "Seja lá o que for, sua pele dá um ótimo traje."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEARGER_FUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEARGER_FUR"
msgid "My, my! That is thick."
msgstr "Olhe só! Como isso é grosso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_FURRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_FURRY"
msgid "I'm not sleeping on the ground."
msgstr "Não vou dormir no chão."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_STRAW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_STRAW"
msgid "I'm not sleeping on the ground."
msgstr "Não vou dormir no chão."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEE.GENERIC"
msgid "Apis mellifera. Quite large!"
msgstr "Apis mellifera. Bem grande!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEE.HELD"
msgid "It is not pleased."
msgstr "Não está feliz."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.BURNT"
msgid "Poor bees!"
msgstr "Pobres abelhas!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.FULLHONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.FULLHONEY"
msgid "Honey can be harvested from it."
msgstr "Pode-se retirar mel dela."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.GENERIC"
msgid "A crude apiary."
msgstr "Um apiário rudimentar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.NOHONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.NOHONEY"
msgid "It's devoid of honey."
msgstr "Está desprovida de mel."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.READY"
msgid "Honey can be harvested from it."
msgstr "Pode-se retirar mel dela."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.SOMEHONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.SOMEHONEY"
msgid "It's not ready for harvesting."
msgstr "Ainda não está pronto para extração."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DOMESTICATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DOMESTICATED"
msgid "While tame, it has become dependent on its human master."
msgstr "Embora manso, se tornou dependente de seu mestre humano."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.FOLLOWER"
msgid "It appears to be following me."
msgstr "Parece que está me seguindo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks almost like a Bos Taurus."
msgstr "É muito parecido com um Bos Taurus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.NAKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.NAKED"
msgid "It looks cold."
msgstr "Parece estar com frio."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.ORNERY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.ORNERY"
msgid "The creature has developed a nasty disposition."
msgstr "A criatura desenvolveu um caráter desagradabilíssimo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.PUDGY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.PUDGY"
msgid "Abundant nourishment has led to an amicable personality."
msgstr "A abundância de alimento o levou a ter uma personalidade amistosa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.RIDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.RIDER"
msgid "This one seems lean and athletic."
msgstr "Esse parece esguio e atlético."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.SLEEPING"
msgid "It's sleeping."
msgstr "Está dormindo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOHAT"
msgid "This hat is hideous."
msgstr "Esse chapéu é horrível."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOWOOL"
msgid "Long follicles harvested from the beefalo."
msgstr "Folículos longos colhidos do bífalo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEGUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEGUARD"
msgid "Very angry Apis mellifera workers!"
msgstr "Apis mellifera trabalhadoras muito irritadas!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEHAT"
msgid "Appropriate protective equipment is a must!"
msgstr "Equipamentos protetivos adequados são uma necessidade básica!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEHIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEHIVE"
msgid "The natural home of the bee."
msgstr "O lar natural da abelha."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE"
msgid "A dangerous mine filled with Antophila."
msgstr "Uma mina perigosa cheia de Antophila."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE_MAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE_MAXWELL"
msgid "A dangerous mine filled with Culicidae."
msgstr "Uma mina perigosa cheia de Culicidae."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEEN"
msgid "The workers ferociously protect her."
msgstr "As trabalhadoras a protegem ferozmente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GENERIC"
msgid "Thick Apis mellifera honeycomb."
msgstr "Um favo de mel grosso de Apis mellifera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GROWING"
msgid "The Apis mellifera are constructing a new hive."
msgstr "As Apis mellifera estão construindo uma nova colmeia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVEGROWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVEGROWN"
msgid "An Apis mellifera nest of unusual size."
msgstr "Um ninho de Apis mellifera de tamanho incomum."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX"
msgid "Naturally antibacterial. Could slow food decay if we use it properly."
msgstr "Naturalmente bactericida. Poderia diminuir o apodrecimento da comida se usada adequadamente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BELL"
msgid "Quiet! This is a library!"
msgstr "Silêncio! Estamos em uma biblioteca!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_ACTIVE"
msgid "That teddy bear seems to be animated somehow."
msgstr "Esse ursinho parece estar animado de alguma forma."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.BROKEN"
msgid "That bear is in need of repair."
msgstr "Esse urso precisa ser consertado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a teddy bear."
msgstr "É um ursinho de pelúcia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BERRIES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BERRIES"
msgid "Some Ardisia crenata berries, I think."
msgstr "Algumas bagas de Ardisia crenata, eu acho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_COOKED"
msgid "Roasted Ardisia crenata, just in case."
msgstr "Ardisia crenata assada, só para garantir."

