#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ASH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ASH.GENERIC"
msgid "Leftovers from a fire. I wish it was still here."
msgstr "Restos de uma fogueira. Gostaria que ainda estivesse aqui."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_EYE_BONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_EYE_BONE"
msgid "I bet that eye thing was quite a sight wreathed in fire!"
msgstr "Aposto que esse olho estranho coberto de fogo foi uma maravilha!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_GLOMMERFLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_GLOMMERFLOWER"
msgid "I wish I saw the way that weird flower burned."
msgstr "Eu queria ter visto como aquela flor estranha queimou."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_THINGIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_THINGIE"
msgid "I wish this thing was still burning, whatever it was."
msgstr "Eu queria que essa coisa ainda estivesse queimando, seja lá o que for."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.CHARGING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.CHARGING"
msgid "Something weird's going on."
msgstr "Tem algo estranho rolando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.COOLDOWN"
msgid "I'll come back another time."
msgstr "Vou voltar outra hora."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.DESTABILIZING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.DESTABILIZING"
msgid "Is it gonna explode?!"
msgstr "Vai explodir?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.OFF"
msgid "Why would anyone want to live down here?"
msgstr "Por que alguém iria querer viver lá embaixo?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.ON"
msgid "It lit up!"
msgstr "Está aceso!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_KEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_KEY"
msgid "The horns make it really easy to turn."
msgstr "Os chifres deixam mais fácil de girar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.OFF"
msgid "Ew, creepy."
msgstr "Eca, assustador."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.ON"
msgid "It's somehow even creepier when it's on."
msgstr "É ainda mais assustador quando está ligado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_OVERGROWTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_OVERGROWTH"
msgid "It's in some other language."
msgstr "Está em alguma outra língua."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_1"
msgid "It's got a picture of some gross looking people."
msgstr "Tem uma imagem de um povo inseto nojento."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_2"
msgid "Can't tell what that was a picture of."
msgstr "Não consigo identificar o que tinha nessa imagem."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_3"
msgid "I think someone spilled ink on this picture."
msgstr "Acho que alguém derramou tinta nessa imagem."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_4"
msgid "Oh, gross! The people're losing their skin in this one!"
msgstr "Eca, nojento! As pessoas estão perdendo sua pele nessa!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_5"
msgid "It's just a picture of a city."
msgstr "É só uma imagem de uma cidade."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_STATUE"
msgid "Eerily lifelike."
msgstr "Incrivelmente real."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.AXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.AXE"
msgid "It's very sharp."
msgstr "É bem afiado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.GENERIC"
msgid "Even the babies are ugly."
msgstr "Até os bebês são feios."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.SLEEPING"
msgid "WAKE UP!"
msgstr "ACORDE!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BACKPACK"
msgid "You could fit like a million lighters in here."
msgstr "Daria pra colocar, tipo, um milhão de isqueiros aí dentro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BACONEGGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BACONEGGS"
msgid "The yellow mucus-y part is gross, but the bacon is great!"
msgstr "A parte mucosa amarela é nojenta, mas o bacon é ótimo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BALLOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BALLOON"
msgid "That's just asking to be popped."
msgstr "Está pedindo pra ser estourado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BALLOONS_EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BALLOONS_EMPTY"
msgid "I could fill them with flammable gas."
msgstr "Eu poderia encher eles com gás inflamável."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE"
msgid "Eww, no!"
msgstr "Eca, não!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BASALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BASALT"
msgid "It's too hard to break!"
msgstr "É muito duro para quebrar!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BAT"
msgid "Cute little guy!"
msgstr "Carinha fofinho!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BATBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BATBAT"
msgid "That thing's great for batting at enemies."
msgstr "Isso é ótimo pra acertar os inimigos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BATCAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BATCAVE"
msgid "What would happen if I dropped a match in there?"
msgstr "O que será que acontece se eu soltar um fósforo aí?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BATWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BATWING"
msgid "Yuck!"
msgstr "Eca!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BATWING_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BATWING_COOKED"
msgid "Still yuck!"
msgstr "Ainda é nojento!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEARDHAIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEARDHAIR"
msgid "Clean up your gross hair guys! Ugh!"
msgstr "Limpem esses pelos sujos, caras! Ugh!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEARGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEARGER"
msgid "Whoa! Niiiice bear..."
msgstr "Opa! Urso amigo..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEARGERVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEARGERVEST"
msgid "It's like swimming in fur."
msgstr "É como nadar em pelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEARGER_FUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEARGER_FUR"
msgid "It's fur all the way down."
msgstr "É feito totalmente de pelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_FURRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_FURRY"
msgid "It's too frilly."
msgstr "É muito cheio de babados."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_STRAW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_STRAW"
msgid "Musty."
msgstr "Mofado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's fat, but that stinger looks dangerous."
msgstr "É gorda, mas o ferrão parece perigoso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEE.HELD"
msgid "Pocket full of bees!"
msgstr "Bolso cheio de abelhas!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.BURNT"
msgid "Smoked you out!"
msgstr "Esfumacei vocês!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.FULLHONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.FULLHONEY"
msgid "Yay! Let's steal honey!"
msgstr "Uhu! Vamos roubar mel!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.GENERIC"
msgid "Come on fat bees, make honey!"
msgstr "Vamos suas abelhas gordas, façam mel!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.NOHONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.NOHONEY"
msgid "Nothing to see here."
msgstr "Não há nada pra ver aqui."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.READY"
msgid "Yay! Let's steal honey!"
msgstr "Uhu! Vamos roubar mel!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.SOMEHONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.SOMEHONEY"
msgid "Patience."
msgstr "Paciência."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DOMESTICATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DOMESTICATED"
msgid "It's lost the fire from its heart."
msgstr "Perdeu a chama de seu coração."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.FOLLOWER"
msgid "Er, are you following me?"
msgstr "Ahm... Você está me seguindo?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.GENERIC"
msgid "What a disgusting, hairy beast!"
msgstr "Que bicho peludo nojento!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.NAKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.NAKED"
msgid "Ha! He's all naked now!"
msgstr "Rá! Ele está totalmente pelado agora!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.ORNERY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.ORNERY"
msgid "I can see fire in its eyes."
msgstr "Vejo fogo em seus olhos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.PUDGY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.PUDGY"
msgid "You need to burn some calories."
msgstr "Você precisa queimar umas calorias."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.RIDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.RIDER"
msgid "Let's go!"
msgstr "Vamos nessa!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.SLEEPING"
msgid "They look even dumber when they're sleeping."
msgstr "Eles parecem ainda mais idiotas quando estão dormindo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOHAT"
msgid "Beast hair to go over people hair!"
msgstr "Cabelo de bicho pra colocar em cima do cabelo de pessoas!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOWOOL"
msgid "Ha! Its owner is probably naked somewhere. Or dead."
msgstr "Ha! Seu dono provavelmente está peladão em algum lugar. Ou morto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEGUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEGUARD"
msgid "Puffy flying jerk!"
msgstr "Trouxa voadora inchada!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEHAT"
msgid "This will keep the pokeys off of me."
msgstr "Isso vai deixar os pontudos longe de mim."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEHIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEHIVE"
msgid "It's full of bees!"
msgstr "Está cheia de abelhas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE"
msgid "Bees inside. Should've put some fire in there for good measure."
msgstr "Abelhas no interior. Deveria ter colocado um pouco de fogo lá dentro só para garantir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE_MAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE_MAXWELL"
msgid "Mosquitoes inside. They don't sound happy."
msgstr "Tem mosquitos lá dentro. Eles não parecem felizes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEEN"
msgid "No amount of honey is worth THAT!"
msgstr "Nenhuma quantidade de mel vale ISSO!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GENERIC"
msgid "It all came from a bee's butt."
msgstr "Tudo isso saiu da bunda da abelha."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GROWING"
msgid "Ew, burn it before it gets any bigger!"
msgstr "Eca, queime isso antes que fique maior!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVEGROWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVEGROWN"
msgid "Dare you guys to smack it with a hammer."
msgstr "Desafio vocês a baterem nisso com um martelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX"
msgid "That's none of my beeswax."
msgstr "Não quero dar uma de abelhuda."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BELL"
msgid "Is it New Year's Eve? Are there FIREWORKS?!"
msgstr "É véspera de Ano Novo? Onde estão os FOGOS?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_ACTIVE"
msgid "Help me, Bernie!"
msgstr "Me ajuda, Bernie!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.BROKEN"
msgid "I need to fix Bernie up."
msgstr "Preciso consertar o Bernie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.GENERIC"
msgid "My childhood buddy - Bernie!"
msgstr "Meu amigo de infância, o Bernie!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRIES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRIES"
msgid "Red berries taste the best."
msgstr "As bagas vermelhas têm o melhor gosto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_COOKED"
msgid "Red berries with fire somehow taste even better."
msgstr "Bagas vermelhas com fogo de alguma forma têm um gosto ainda melhor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY"
msgid "Mmm. They pop in your mouth."
msgstr "Hmm. Elas estouram na boca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY_COOKED"
msgid "Fire improves everything."
msgstr "O fogo melhora tudo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BARREN"
msgid "Eat poop, stupid plant!"
msgstr "Coma cocô, planta idiota!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BURNING"
msgid "Yes!! Burn!!"
msgstr "Sim!! Queime!!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASED"
msgid "Burn the sick!"
msgstr "Queime as doentes!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASING"
msgid "Blech. You smell."
msgstr "Blerg. Que fedor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.GENERIC"
msgid "Mmmmm. Berries."
msgstr "Mmmmm. Bagas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.PICKED"
msgid "But I want more berries!"
msgstr "Mas eu quero mais bagas!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.WITHERED"
msgid "All dried out. Primed for fire!"
msgstr "Tudo seco. Pronto para o fogo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BARREN"
msgid "Did I say you could stop growing?!"
msgstr "Eu disse que você podia parar de crescer?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BURNING"
msgid "Yes!! Burn!!"
msgstr "Sim!! Queime!!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASED"
msgid "Burn the sick!"
msgstr "Queime as doentes!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASING"
msgid "Blech. You smell."
msgstr "Blerg. Que fedor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.GENERIC"
msgid "Ready for picking!"
msgstr "Pronto pra colheita!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.PICKED"
msgid "Make mooooore!"
msgstr "Faça maaais!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.WITHERED"
msgid "It's burning up."
msgstr "Está queimando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BIGFOOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BIGFOOT"
msgid "What in the world!"
msgstr "Que porcaria!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BIRCHNUTDRAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BIRCHNUTDRAKE"
msgid "Aaah! Set it on fire!"
msgstr "Aaah! Fogo neles!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.DEAD"
msgid "At least he's quiet now."
msgstr "Pelo menos está quieto agora."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.GENERIC"
msgid "Bird prison!"
msgstr "Prisão de passarinho!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.HUNGRY"
msgid "What's all the fuss about?"
msgstr "Por que de toda essa comoção?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.OCCUPIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.OCCUPIED"
msgid "Ha! Gotcha now!"
msgstr "Rá! Peguei você!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SKELETON"
msgid "That should probably be cleaned up."
msgstr "Acho que isso deveria ser limpo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SLEEPING"
msgid "Stupid bird. Wake up!"
msgstr "Passarinho idiota. Acorda!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.STARVING"
msgid "He won't be quiet!"
msgstr "Ele não fica quieto!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BIRDTRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BIRDTRAP"
msgid "Gonna catch those creepy birds."
msgstr "Vamos pegar esses pássaros nojentos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG"
msgid "It smells like a bird's butt."
msgstr "Tem cheiro de bunda de passarinho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG_COOKED"
msgid "Yuck. The yellow part is all runny."
msgstr "Eca. A parte amarela é meio líquida."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BISHOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BISHOP"
msgid "It's a bishop!"
msgstr "É um bispo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_CHARGE_HIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_CHARGE_HIT"
msgid "Owwww!"
msgstr "Aiii!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_NIGHTMARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_NIGHTMARE"
msgid "Ahhh!"
msgstr "Ahhh!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_FIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_FIRE"
msgid "That's my favorite thing in the whole wide world."
msgstr "Essa é minha coisa preferida em todo o mundo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA"
msgid "Ptoo! Now you're dead!"
msgstr "Pfu! Agora você morreu!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA2"
msgid "Ooh, the firepower!"
msgstr "Uh, que poder de fogo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_PIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_PIPE"
msgid "Good practice for blowing into a fire."
msgstr "Boa prática para soprar o fogo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_SLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_SLEEP"
msgid "Tranquilized things are easier to light on fire."
msgstr "Coisas tranquilizadas são mais fáceis de colocar fogo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_YELLOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_YELLOW"
msgid "Lightning is sort of like fire."
msgstr "O relâmpago é parecido com o fogo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BLUEAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BLUEAMULET"
msgid "Boo to this."
msgstr "Cai fora!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BLUEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BLUEGEM"
msgid "Ugh. This one is ugly."
msgstr "Ugh. Essa é feia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BLUEMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BLUEMOONEYE"
msgid "That's not an eyeball! It's a rock!"
msgstr "Não é um globo ocular! É uma rocha!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.COMMON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.COMMON"
msgid "This will save some experimentation."
msgstr "Isso vai evitar a experimentação."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.RARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.RARE"
msgid "Woah. It doesn't burn!!"
msgstr "Uau. Não queima!!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP"
msgid "It smells like a gym sock!"
msgstr "Tem cheiro de meia de atletismo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP_COOKED"
msgid "Transformed by fire!"
msgstr "Transformado pelo fogo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.GENERIC"
msgid "Dumb mushroom."
msgstr "Cogumelo idiota."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.INGROUND"
