#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.BLOOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.BLOOM"
